  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: stack buffer overflow in MNG/JNG encoder \u2014 missing NULL\n     check after ImageToBlob() in WriteOneJNGImage could propagate a NULL blob\n     pointer into later stack buffer operations (GHSA-7h7q-j33q-hvpf).\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-28690.patch: bail out of WriteOneJNGImage when\n       ImageToBlob() returns NULL, destroying jpeg_image and jpeg_image_info\n       before returning MagickFalse (upstream e6e874875e48dd9838acca3bd22c14a4d2f1b3ca)\n     - CVE-2026-28690",
